00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:05,816
Most people fear public speaking more than almost anything else.

2
00:00:05,766 --> 00:00:09,966
Preparation is the best cure for nerves.

3
00:00:09,966 --> 00:00:15,266
Practise out loud and time yourself before the real talk.

4
00:00:15,266 --> 00:00:20,116
Look at friendly faces in the audience to feel calm.

